{"about_the_game":"Ping Pong Space is a modern incarnation of the classic arcade Pong game, set in space.<br><br>Travel through the expanse of endless space, playing retro tennis with a computer and overcome the many different obstacles that you encounter along the way. The gameplay is essentially a reimagining of air hockey and classic Atari's Pong with new additional elements. The game has new rules; the blocks and mechanisms in the arenas can both help you win and lead you to defeat, and the drop-down bonuses both please and disappoint, it all depends on your dexterity and skills. Complete every level alone or play with your friend in two-player mode. Immerse yourself in a fascinating journey through the cosmic world.<br>Are you ready to fight artificial intelligence and win?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1193930/extras/b3d56ec47e5f7c66953b27c4ca57ef4f.avif?t=1619453178\" width=610 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An atmospheric space setting </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A unique blend of table tennis and breakout games </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 1 or 2 player modes </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Two difficulty modes to suit your style of play </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 60 challenging levels, 9 colorful arenas </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Difficult, fast-paced gameplay in hard mode </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Special bonuses including the small ball, speedball, and lasers </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Steam achievements (medals and cup) and leaderboards </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Controller support (Keyboard still required for text input) </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enjoy the old school sports game with improved graphics </li></ul><br>Don't let the invaders take over the world! Accept the challenge to defeat the AI robot and become the retro tennis champion of the galaxy.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"66e539a25eee27e87828a4a6d541b6876cc732f3.jpg","localized_name":"Joystick","name":"Joystick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/66e539a25eee27e87828a4a6d541b6876cc732f3.jpg"},{"icon":"20160e41ca15736e066c3ea8c2a60dfb4eb4b840.jpg","localized_name":"Timekeeper","name":"Timekeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/20160e41ca15736e066c3ea8c2a60dfb4eb4b840.jpg"},{"icon":"8cd82350cb36ce8f2874ccb5a28feacaaf8026f1.jpg","localized_name":"Cup","name":"Cup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/8cd82350cb36ce8f2874ccb5a28feacaaf8026f1.jpg"},{"icon":"a0f59153efc81a8787ec3530b0dd8c7901de6834.jpg","localized_name":"Star","name":"Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/a0f59153efc81a8787ec3530b0dd8c7901de6834.jpg"},{"icon":"8164bafab226de5e711a170bca3b08f66b1f0d6b.jpg","localized_name":"Speedball","name":"Speedball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/8164bafab226de5e711a170bca3b08f66b1f0d6b.jpg"},{"icon":"1cea335564b72a4bc2ab92724ee8e584ab587f98.jpg","localized_name":"Copper medal","name":"Copper medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/1cea335564b72a4bc2ab92724ee8e584ab587f98.jpg"},{"icon":"b3f97dbf381438e05cd5ebbf19b30e6ae5114aca.jpg","localized_name":"Bronze medal","name":"Bronze medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/b3f97dbf381438e05cd5ebbf19b30e6ae5114aca.jpg"},{"icon":"62948fb27d7f2c2df403cbf63b5685ff39658dd4.jpg","localized_name":"Silver medal","name":"Silver medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1193930/62948fb27d7f2c2df403cbf63b5685ff39658dd4.jpg"},{"icon":"884e64b77eebec1fc21eda2e59c8d47816e033c9.jpg"